Description: SecuBox DPI Analytics — nDPId/sbxdpi app/protocol classification
 Analytics layer over the SecuBox DPI pipeline: top applications, top
 protocols, bandwidth-by-app, bandwidth-by-device, talkers, and risk
 visualization.
 .
 netifyd is RETIRED (like CrowdSec) : the live engine is full nDPId
 (nDPI 5.x → nDPIsrvd → sbxdpi, dpi-live.sock). This package no longer
 depends on or wants netifyd ; the legacy netifyd-socket endpoints remain
 only until the nDPI cutover replaces them. See secubox-ndpid for the
 JA3/JA4 TLS-fingerprinting nDPId dashboard.
 .
 Port Debian bookworm de luci-app-netifyd-dashboard (SecuBox OpenWrt
 / CyberMind.fr).
